      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "王处回夜启义兴门告赵季良，处回泣不已，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d930d4fb-bd05-55d7-98f0-ca6cf5d7a587",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "季良正色曰：“今强将握兵，专伺时变，宜速立嗣君以绝觊觎，岂可但相泣邪！”"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d9fbb559-16c2-5925-92f6-351410dcb4f9",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "季良教处回见李什罕，审其词旨然后告之。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "e3f9cdee-d9ec-54fa-b5db-5b14978ef884",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "甲子，立子东川节度使、同平章事、亲卫马步都指挥使仁赞为太子，仍监国。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "e7b994e7-4a76-5dd9-adaa-00624ef77bde",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "王处回夜启义兴门告赵季良，处回泣不已，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "e9c426a9-a54e-577f-8845-0c7a9021e972",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "季良教处回见李什罕，审其词旨然后告之。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "ea82bda2-8f75-5efa-b696-831b77bac6ea",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "召司空、同平章事赵季良、武信节度使李仁罕、保宁节度使赵廷隐、枢密使王处回、捧圣控鹤都指挥使张公鐸、奉銮肃卫指挥副使侯弘实受遣诏辅政。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "edb50c9a-2090-5977-8ace-6f88b6115078",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "召司空、同平章事赵季良、武信节度使李仁罕、保宁节度使赵廷隐、枢密使王处回、捧圣控鹤都指挥使张公鐸、奉銮肃卫指挥副使侯弘实受遣诏辅政。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "fc0210c9-1849-510a-b954-38b3132fd5cb",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-shu-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "7e32d56fc85a5e813a170ee3a1268eb86e3f8695cedd9b3081c79eb58d8578f2",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "处回收泪谢之。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "05a056a2-f0cc-520b-a138-01c3066e3a62",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-136-meng-death/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-136-meng-death/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "020bee05dcaa5296f93071715393c97262edc58ca3baa56e27221f283557fce4",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "七月卒，年六十一。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "108ac282-08ab-5c30-9af6-33fb29892f67",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-two-towns-join-shu/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-two-towns-join-shu/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "6330d8aba66de860baa0a20e77d95aac5d6d1cc208568b68ce0595fdba5d7400",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "知祥卒，謚為文武聖德英烈明孝皇帝，廟號高祖，陵曰和陵。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "51c795b6-b6ad-5d43-aeb8-afb2e2376ece",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-meng-secret-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-meng-secret-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "3d8bfc12d0bdcda50cfd6613a0d7fc409c0e8d8535d05f8a8c061396b555ddb1",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "季良正色曰：「今疆侯握兵，專伺時變，當速立嗣君以絕非望，泣無益也。」"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "c24e2cde-a76e-57e6-958c-5d9ddaea2047",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-meng-secret-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-meng-secret-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "3d8bfc12d0bdcda50cfd6613a0d7fc409c0e8d8535d05f8a8c061396b555ddb1",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "王處回夜過趙季良，相對泣涕不已，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d01d7fb4-4103-5687-b3e5-a996f0a166e6",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-two-towns-join-shu/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-two-towns-join-shu/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "6330d8aba66de860baa0a20e77d95aac5d6d1cc208568b68ce0595fdba5d7400",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "遂病，以其子昶為皇太子監國。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d2330bf7-d64a-5747-b3f5-4f79e25be4a7",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-meng-secret-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-meng-secret-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "3d8bfc12d0bdcda50cfd6613a0d7fc409c0e8d8535d05f8a8c061396b555ddb1",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "知祥已卒而祕未發，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d6ff5cbe-67b9-5394-bafe-42dad83d013b",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/4b8f7b80/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-275/year-0927/part-05/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-136-mengchang-parentage/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-275/year-0927/part-05/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-136-mengchang-parentage/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "690886a1edc6033cd65c61ab09e4ea0c088e866470ff7761b428d64590ef0551",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "知祥卒，遂襲其偽位，時年十六，尚稱明德元年。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d8f26131-8409-5014-bfa7-bcd45c20c0b1",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/5f4233fa/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-meng-secret-succession/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-064-meng-secret-succession/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "3d8bfc12d0bdcda50cfd6613a0d7fc409c0e8d8535d05f8a8c061396b555ddb1",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "處回遂與季良立昶，而後發喪。昶立，不改元，仍稱明德，"
    }
  ]
}
